ychonautWiki","page":"Deschloroketamine","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Deschloroketamine#Pharmacology"},"uses":{"text":"Deschloroketamine (DXE, DCK, 2'-Oxo-PCM) is a dissociative anesthetic that has been sold online as a designer drug.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"Deschloroketamine","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deschloroketamine"},"zh":"去氯愷他命","zhOther":"去氯恺他命","summaryZh":"2-苯基-2-甲氨基環己酮是一種含氮有機化合物，分子式C13H17NO，屬於芳基環己胺類化合物，可作為麻醉劑和解離劑，2018年列入《非藥用類麻醉藥品和精神藥品名錄》。"}